Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.10,0:09:24.60,Title,0,0,0,0,,《新猛鬼街：梦杀》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.07,0:02:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再来杯咖啡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I have another?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.74,0:02:53.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}麻烦 再来杯咖啡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Can I have some more coffee, please?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.52,0:02:56.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别走啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where you going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.42,0:03:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}劳驾{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.86,0:03:04.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}泼妇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.83,0:03:10.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有人吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.47,0:03:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有人吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.85,0:03:26.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有人吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.30,0:03:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小姐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady. Lady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.27,0:03:56.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有人吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.75,0:04:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}搞什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.48,0:04:38.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阿斌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean. Dean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.55,0:04:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}若你再睡下去 会被赶出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you, if you keep falling asleep, they're gonna kick you out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.36,0:04:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对不起 下次不敢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, sorry. Won't happen again, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.53,0:04:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.13,0:05:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 南希 - 克莉丝 快坐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nancy. - Hey, Kris. You can sit wherever you want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.90,0:05:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 其实我是来找阿斌 - 他就在那{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Actually, I'm just here to meet Dean. - Oh, he's right over there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.14,0:05:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.48,0:05:39.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.15,0:05:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你看起来好像…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow, you look like you haven't…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.78,0:05:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}三日没睡过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I haven't slept in three days?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.12,0:05:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阿斌 发生什么事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, what's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.43,0:05:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}接下来做什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what are we doing after this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.19,0:05:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看是否有可去的地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me see if we can go to Ashley's or whatever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.90,0:05:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我没什么主意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.67,0:06:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你女友来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out, here comes your girlfriend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.57,0:06:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 嘿 - 还想要什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, hey. - Hi. Can I get you guys anything else?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.07,0:06:08.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯 嗯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh… Um…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.08,0:06:14.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}够了 我们准备埋单{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I think we're good. We'll just get the check.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.92,0:06:19.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伟庭 你就只会跟她说这些{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that the only thing you wanna ask her, Quentin?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.46,0:06:26.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}蠢材{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Asshole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.47,0:06:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.50,0:06:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克莉丝和阿斌在一起喔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why is Kris with Dean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.54,0:06:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.71,0:06:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.08,0:06:48.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}该死的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's fucked up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.05,0:06:51.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that all about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.62,0:06:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}杰西还因和克莉丝分手而耿耿于怀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, Jesse's just… He's pissed because Kris broke up with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.09,0:06:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我不知道他们在一起过 - 嗯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I didn't even know they were together. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.13,0:07:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}找钱不要吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I can keep the change?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.43,0:07:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Look…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.83,0:07:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很抱歉桌面弄得如斯杂乱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I'm sorry about the mess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.34,0:07:10.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 他们只是… - 我习惯了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- These guys are just… - I'm used to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.90,0:07:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你厌倦每个周末都于此工作吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you ever get tired of working here every weekend?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.47,0:07:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那你厌烦每个周末都到此吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you ever get tired of coming here every weekend?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.64,0:07:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伟庭 还不快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quentin. You coming or no?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.15,0:07:27.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很抱歉 应保持桌面整洁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. Look, this should take care of the rest of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.66,0:07:30.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 再见 - 再见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- See you around. - See you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.10,0:07:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或者你应告知其他人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, maybe you should talk to somebody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.57,0:07:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.80,0:07:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他认为问题发生在之前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he thinks all my problems come from my past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.61,0:07:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我童年那时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We began going through my childhood…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.81,0:07:50.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就在那时开始{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and that's when they started.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.68,0:07:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}开始什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When what started?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.35,0:07:55.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}诸此恶梦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These nightmares.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.28,0:07:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恶梦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nightmares.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.72,0:08:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不能入睡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what, you can't sleep?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.69,0:08:04.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我能入睡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.39,0:08:07.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过我不想入睡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just don't want to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.20,0:08:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听我说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Dean, listen to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.30,0:08:13.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只是梦 不是真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're just dreams. Okay? They're not real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.80,0:08:16.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些梦…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These dreams…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.90,0:08:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是真实{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…they're real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.67,0:08:19.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只是梦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.14,0:08:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是梦 对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're re… I'm sorry, Kris.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.88,0:08:24.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 好的 - 克莉丝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, it's okay. - Kris.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.11,0:08:27.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没事 我去整理一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. It's fine. I'm gonna go clean myself off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.55,0:08:28.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.48,0:09:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只是梦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.08,0:09:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只是梦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not real. You're not real!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.15,0:09:05.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不是梦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.35,0:09:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阿斌 你在干嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, what are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.69,0:09:09.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 只是梦 - 住手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're not real. - Dean, stop it. Dean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.32,0:09:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}住手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, stop it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.43,0:09:16.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阿斌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.50,0:09:19.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阿斌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.24,0:09:33.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}悲痛震动我们的内心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tragedy can shake us at our core…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.91,0:09:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它使我们团结与互勉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and it can also unite us in our shared grief.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.69,0:09:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们在这天共聚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today we are gathered and united…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.29,0:09:45.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为此人的逝去与他生前的痛楚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…for the tragic loss of a young man with so much life ahead of him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.96,0:09:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我们祈祷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us pray.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.30,0:09:53.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝 请将死亡的阴影{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lord, you who can turn the shadow of death…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.47,0:09:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}转化为明亮的新一日{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…into the light of a new day…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.60,0:10:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们将阿斌托付于你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…as we gather to commend Dean into your hands…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.97,0:10:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有助我们以忏悔的心仰望你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…help us to wait upon thee with penitent hearts…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.08,0:10:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}警惕我们 他的逝去就是我们的存在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and remind us of he who died that we might live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.57,0:10:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}权力和荣耀直到永远 阿门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the power and the glory forever and ever. Amen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.11,0:10:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 天啊 - 没事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Amen. - Come on, sweetie. It's over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.81,0:10:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.16,0:10:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来慰问下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go say hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.72,0:10:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 歌雯 还好吧 - 阿兰 你好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Gwen. Hi, how are you? - Alan, hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.86,0:10:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 好久不见 - 是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's been a long time. - Yeah, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.67,0:11:01.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 尤其在这些情形 - 不过…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Especially under these circumstances. - Yeah, not a…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.10,0:11:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}南希 若你想找人倾诉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Nance, if you need someone to talk to…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.77,0:11:07.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我没事 有劳关心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm okay. Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.34,0:11:09.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们在学校设置了应急中心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're setting up a crisis center at the school.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.64,0:11:13.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你知道我办公点吧 - 嗯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know where my office is, right, Nancy? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.18,0:11:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我们要离开了 珍重 - 见到你真高兴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're gonna head out. Take care. - Good to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.68,0:11:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再见 伟庭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye-bye, Quentin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.50,0:11:38.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你认识阿斌很久了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew Dean that far back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.11,0:11:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那女孩是我 但不知为何在此照片里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus, that is me. But I don't know how I'm in that picture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.41,0:11:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在高中才认识阿斌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't meet Dean until high school.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.65,0:11:47.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.72,0:11:54.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 阿斌死前若有所言 - 节哀顺变{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean said something right before he died. - Oh, please don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.32,0:11:58.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他说「只是梦」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said, "You're not real."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.32,0:12:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}重复不止{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He kept repeating it over and over again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.53,0:12:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}知其含义吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any idea what that means?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.50,0:12:09.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.34,0:12:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有什么含义 或许他嗑药了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think about it. What would it mean? Dean was on a load of medication when…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.97,0:12:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}杰西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.38,0:12:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}事发时 如有人在迫他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When it happened, it was like somebody was making him do it…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.95,0:12:22.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但根本没人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but there was nobody there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.55,0:12:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}杰西 你要相信我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesse, you have to believe me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.46,0:12:32.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克莉丝 你受惊过度才有这种想法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kris, it was late and you were scared. Your mind was just playing tricks on you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.76,0:12:34.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我相信你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.67,0:12:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你相信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.44,0:12:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我经历过…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.61,0:12:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我看见… - 你根本没经历过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I saw… - You didn't see anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.24,0:12:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你又不是当事人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You weren't right there. Kris was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.45,0:12:55.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她很混乱 让她冷静下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's already fucked up, so leave her alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.39,0:13:01.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你根本不知道我经历过什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no idea what I've seen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.36,0:13:06.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}回家吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.91,0:14:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 嗨 - 嗨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi. - Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.34,0:14:35.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}妈妈 我在找儿时的照片{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Mom, where are all the photos of me from when I was younger?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.58,0:14:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 不在这 - 谁晓得{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They're not here. - Oh, well, who knows?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.08,0:14:40.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可能放在车库 怎么了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're probably packed away over the garage. Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.99,0:14:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今日在葬礼上…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because today at the funeral I, um…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.29,0:14:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我看到我和阿斌的儿时合照{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw a photo of Dean and I when we were, like, 5.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.90,0:14:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好奇怪 我是在高中才认识阿斌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, you know, it's funny, I don't remember knowing Dean before high school.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.30,0:14:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谁能记得五岁时的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who can remember being 5 years old?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.80,0:15:00.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快收拾好 晚膳已备好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, why don't you pack those up? Dinner's almost ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.75,0:15:14.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}晚安 乖女儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night, honey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.04,0:17:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}记得我吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.98,0:17:52.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克莉丝 没事吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kris? You okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.10,0:18:10.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.86,0:18:12.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.90,0:18:14.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好像是速写画{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just, like, a sketch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.50,0:18:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.67,0:18:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 很好 - 是吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, I'm okay. - Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.84,0:18:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那你呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.38,0:18:26.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还用说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.95,0:18:32.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}若你需要找人谈话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, like, if you ever need somebody, if you ever wanna talk to somebody, l…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.89,0:18:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我猜有一大堆人愿意听{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure you have like a thousand other people you could talk to…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.26,0:18:38.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我亦是当中的一份子…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but if you wanna talk to somebody…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.29,0:18:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.66,0:18:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伟庭 要迟到了 快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quentin. You're gonna be late to class. Come on, buddy, let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.10,0:18:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我爸爸 - 我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My dad. - I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.67,0:18:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正是伯里克利告诉雅典人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, class, it was Pericles who told the Athenian people…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.34,0:18:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们应聚集到城门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…they should all gather into the gates of the city…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.04,0:19:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}同时他的海军舰队摧毁斯巴达人的航道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…while his naval fleet picked off the Spartans by sea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.28,0:19:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在胜利已在握{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, it was to be a slow but sure victory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.92,0:19:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伯里克利曰“斯巴达人绝不会攻下雅典卫城墙”{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Spartans would never make it over the walls of the acropolis, Pericles said.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.42,0:19:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但他没料到会被瘟疫打败{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what he didn't take into account is that the plague would eventually strike.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.96,0:19:15.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}翻到书中八十四页{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open your books to page 84.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.70,0:19:19.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}情形更复杂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To further complicate matters…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.37,0:19:22.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}斯巴达人配备了各种各样武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the Spartans were armed with a variety of weapons…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.67,0:19:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当中有些武器是即场组装{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…some of them even improvised.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.77,0:19:28.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们不停屠杀雅典人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they would not hesitate to slaughter every Athenian they saw…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.71,0:19:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}甚至孩童{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…even children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.64,0:19:35.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尤其是士兵的小孩…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Especially the children of soldiers. This is where the…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.38,0:19:36.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}醒醒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.95,0:19:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}醒醒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake up, wake up, wake up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.72,0:19:46.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你上课不该打瞌睡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really shouldn't fall asleep in class.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.94,0:19:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你好 克莉丝 - 你是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi, Kris. - Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.34,0:20:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你看起来更甚…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look just as beautiful…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.84,0:20:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}漂亮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…as ever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.12,0:20:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不用担心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have nothing to worry about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.49,0:20:15.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不痛的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This won't hurt…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.16,0:20:17.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}…只会有…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…one…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.96,0:20:19.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}…一点点…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…little…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.99,0:20:21.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}…痛而已…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…bit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.10,0:20:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没事吧 霍士小姐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay, Miss Fowles?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.97,0:20:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.00,0:20:31.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.41,0:20:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.76,0:20:56.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克莉丝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kris!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.00,0:21:32.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}路路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rufus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.07,0:21:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}路路 你怎么了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rufus, what are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.37,0:21:38.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么会在屋外{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh? What are you doing out here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.11,0:21:40.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}进来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.97,0:21:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}路路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rufus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.54,0:21:47.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.67,0:22:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.87,0:22:14.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今晚我要搭夜航班去伦敦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to fly to London on a redeye tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.24,0:22:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.18,0:22:20.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无恙吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna be okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.31,0:22:23.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.55,0:22:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我安好无恙 一路顺风{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna be all right. Have a safe flight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.29,0:22:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只是担心你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just worry about you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.72,0:22:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 要多休息 - 好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Try and get some sleep. - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.22,0:22:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}下机后我会致电你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll call you when I land.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.33,0:22:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我爱你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.83,0:22:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我爱你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.87,0:23:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}杰西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus, Jesse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.94,0:23:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你在这干嘛 - 快让我进去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What the hell are you doing here? - Are you gonna let me in?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.87,0:23:55.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}进来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.58,0:24:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知我蠢材{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I know I've been an asshole…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.65,0:24:06.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我爱吃醋兼懵性{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and I've been jealous and I've been fucked up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.92,0:24:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但阿斌亦是我朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Dean was my friend too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.99,0:24:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}麻烦告诉我发生何事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you please tell me what's been going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.39,0:24:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我做了个梦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm having these dreams.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.30,0:24:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}梦醒仍心有余悸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm scared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.50,0:24:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我猜阿斌亦做过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think Dean was having them too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.21,0:24:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克莉丝 听着 我们都…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kris, listen, we've all…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.68,0:24:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道你要说什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what you're gonna say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.65,0:24:41.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}每次发梦时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now every time I dream…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.52,0:24:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}总会梦见那个男人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I always see this man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.59,0:24:48.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he's…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.03,0:24:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}被烧伤过的男人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's burned…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.73,0:24:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他一直试图{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and melted. And he's always trying to…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.54,0:25:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 用刀攻击我 - 是他的铁刀手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- attack me with these knives… - Knives on his fingers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.38,0:25:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.21,0:25:07.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.75,0:25:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们都做过相同的梦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're having the same dream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.58,0:25:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 不可能 - 事实是这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Kris, it's not possible. - It is possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.82,0:25:15.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 只是梦 对不 - 不只是梦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's just a dream, all right? - It's not a dream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.79,0:25:17.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘘 嘘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shh. Shh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.86,0:25:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘘 嘘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shh. Shh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.76,0:25:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}噢 天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.63,0:25:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我好怕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so afraid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.33,0:25:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我现想入睡 又怕会梦中被杀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I wanna do is go to sleep, but if I do he's gonna kill me like Dean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.10,0:25:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们别再谈这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we should just stop talking about it, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.74,0:25:38.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}唯恐日有所思夜有所梦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We keep talking about it, we'll keep thinking about it, then we'll keep dreaming about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.58,0:25:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}望着我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.25,0:25:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你会陪着我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll stay with me?{\r}
