Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.11,0:39:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你可以起死回生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think you can bring the dead back to life?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.54,0:39:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 不能 - 不能吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. No! - No?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.98,0:39:36.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}深有同感{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't fucking think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.62,0:39:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.25,0:39:45.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你尖叫什么 我还没动手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you screaming? I haven't even cut you yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.73,0:40:27.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我没杀人 我是无辜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't do it! I'm innocent!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.47,0:40:30.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}放我出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me out of here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.94,0:40:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快放我出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me the fuck out of here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.14,0:40:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}知不知道心跳停止后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you know that after the heart stops beating…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.15,0:40:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大脑功能仍能运作超过七分钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the brain keeps functioning for well over seven minutes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.88,0:40:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有六分钟多的时间可以玩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got six more minutes to play.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.53,0:41:00.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 还好吧 - 我只是很累{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You okay? - Yeah. I'm just really exhausted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.34,0:41:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.71,0:41:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 什么玩意 - 振奋剂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's that? - Zoneral.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.91,0:41:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}令你保持活力 我十五岁就开始服用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's basically speed for kids with ADD. I've been on it since I was, like, 15.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.48,0:41:18.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不用 有劳关心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No. No, thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.62,0:41:22.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}南希 你没精打采 没事吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nancy, look, you're running on fumes. Here, okay? Are you sure? It's…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.25,0:41:24.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm fine for now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.96,0:41:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不介意你的信仰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't take you for the religious type.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.93,0:41:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有些东西你得相信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, you gotta believe in something, you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.77,0:41:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's this one doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.97,0:41:45.41,Title,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是本《哈默林的魔笛手》{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's The Pied Piper of Hamelin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.58,0:41:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我梦见此书 其讲述一个被城镇背叛的人…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw it in one of my dreams. It's about a guy who's betrayed by a town…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.25,0:41:52.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}向孩童实行报复的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and he gets his revenge by taking all their children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.45,0:41:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我亦一直梦见到孩童{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I keep dreaming about children too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.72,0:41:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}梦里还有间学校{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then there's also a school.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.09,0:42:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当中深有含义{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's gotta mean something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.49,0:42:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我所指的是 自从六年级我们便没有齐聚上学{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but, I mean, what? We didn't go to school together until, like, 6th grade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.30,0:42:08.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我们在浪费时间 - 什么意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look, we're running out of time. - What do you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.40,0:42:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恶梦相信是非人为控制而产生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nightmares are triggered by the belief that the dreamer has no control…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.97,0:42:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}进而引发失眠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and this can cause insomnia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.24,0:42:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}若长时处于此状态{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then it says at the 70-hour mark…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.24,0:42:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}失眠者会进入瞌睡状态{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the insomniac will begin to experience micronaps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.45,0:42:25.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}人得不到足够睡眠 人便会打瞌睡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"His brain will shut down its functions for seconds in an attempt to recharge."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.28,0:42:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因此你在梦中 亦以为不是在梦中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This basically means that you're dreaming, but you don't know it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.02,0:42:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}即使处于清醒状态{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, even if you're awake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.86,0:42:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大脑亦会因疲倦停止运作 导致昏睡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then it says that after that, your brain will shut down, inducing a coma.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.13,0:42:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}又称深度睡眠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is permanent sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.71,0:42:52.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}南希{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nancy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.21,0:42:57.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}南希{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nancy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.49,0:43:02.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}南希{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nancy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.41,0:43:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.91,0:43:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.31,0:43:30.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.78,0:43:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你去哪了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where have you been?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.58,0:43:35.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我刚在书店{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was at the bookstore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.62,0:43:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只是想知道你行踪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, I didn't know where you were.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.32,0:43:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有预感 你朋友会遭遇不测{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I just feel like, with everything that's been happening with your friends…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.16,0:43:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}妈妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Mom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.90,0:43:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是否同克莉丝…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I have some sort of connection with Kris…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.80,0:43:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阿斌和杰西及伟庭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and Dean and Jesse?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.10,0:43:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有某种关联{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or Quentin?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.00,0:43:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或者我们小时曾共聚上学{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, maybe we went to school together when we were little or something like that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.71,0:43:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有这回事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not that I can recall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.18,0:44:02.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你认识个叫佛莱迪的人吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did we ever know a guy named Freddy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.55,0:44:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不认识{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.42,0:44:14.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.43,0:44:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}晚安{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.44,0:44:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}晚安{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.52,0:44:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是歌雯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, it's Gwen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.49,0:44:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}南希开始记起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nancy's starting to remember.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.26,0:45:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没事吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.53,0:45:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm fine, Mom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.66,0:46:01.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我要入睡了 - 好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right. I'm going to bed. - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.98,0:47:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}南南{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little Nancy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.82,0:47:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}长大成人了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All grown up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.22,0:47:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你只是梦魇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just a nightmare.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.32,0:47:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.39,0:47:36.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没人可证明我曾在此{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one can prove I was ever here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.86,0:47:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.30,0:47:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不记得{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't remember?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.57,0:47:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.24,0:47:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我最痛爱的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're my number one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.65,0:47:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是我的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're my…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.72,0:48:00.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}南南{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…little Nancy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.12,0:48:04.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我设了闹铃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I set an alarm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.12,0:48:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}绝对有啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, you did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.33,0:48:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有在梦中设闹钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In your dream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.33,0:48:14.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你果然与众不同{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You smell different.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.48,0:48:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伟庭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quentin?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.78,0:48:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}南希 他杀死了杰西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nancy, he got to him. Jesse's dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.21,0:48:28.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}杰西在梦中猝死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He died in his sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.61,0:48:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我见过他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.48,0:48:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 刚才睡梦中我梦见他 - 好 我过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I fell asleep. I saw Freddy. - All right, I'm coming over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.02,0:48:36.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.93,0:48:49.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}该死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.91,0:49:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是贝瀚幼稚园{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So Badham's a preschool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.35,0:49:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一间位置偏僻 废置久时的幼稚园{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's on the other end of town. It was closed years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.38,0:49:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}找不到图片{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't find any pictures.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.35,0:49:08.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等等 过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.12,0:49:12.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}梦醒后我画了这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I drew this after my dream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.46,0:49:21.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我未曾见过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I've never seen it before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.40,0:49:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那个人和学校有何联系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is the guy in our dreams connected to the school?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.97,0:49:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.54,0:49:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我知家母略有隐瞒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I know my mom's hiding something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.25,0:49:41.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不在这{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.46,0:49:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}帮我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.34,0:49:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.35,0:50:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们都在这{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're all here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.26,0:50:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克莉丝 杰西 阿斌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kris, Jesse, Dean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.76,0:50:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我 还有你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's me, it's you, it's…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.77,0:50:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们在干嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.44,0:50:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们在干嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.64,0:50:35.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}南希 发生什么事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nancy, what is going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.34,0:50:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 给我照片 - 我不明白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Give me the picture. - I don't understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.31,0:50:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说过我们未曾谋面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said that… You said that we didn't know each other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.48,0:50:47.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我们都在照片里 我们在同间幼稚园{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we're all in this picture. We went to school together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.32,0:50:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给我照片{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the picture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.02,0:50:51.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 够了 - 为何隐瞒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's okay. - Why would you lie to me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.99,0:50:55.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我没隐瞒 - 证据确凿 为何隐瞒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I didn't lie. - It's right here. Why would you lie to me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.63,0:50:58.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 别再隐瞒我 - 我没隐瞒你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stop lying. You're lying to me. - I'm not lying to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.33,0:51:00.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 别再隐瞒我 - 我没隐瞒你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stop lying to me! - I am not lying to you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.13,0:51:04.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不想你带着以往的记忆生活{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't want you to have to go through your life with this memory!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.50,0:51:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只是想你忘记往事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't want you to remember. I wanted you to forget!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.24,0:51:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}忘记什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.91,0:51:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我幼时发什么事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened at that preschool?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.25,0:51:20.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}微笑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smile, everybody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.79,0:51:22.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}精神抖擞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys look great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.82,0:51:27.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有个叫佛莱迪·克鲁格{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a man at the preschool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.03,0:51:30.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}出现于校园{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}His name was Fred Krueger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.06,0:51:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一 二{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, two{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.67,0:51:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}佛莱迪为你而来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freddy's coming for you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.00,0:51:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}三 四 锁好你的门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three, four. Better lock your door{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.27,0:51:40.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是个园丁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a gardener.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.37,0:51:44.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}居住于学校地下室{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He lived in the basement of the preschool…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.34,0:51:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而你们取笑他的人生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}… and you kids were his life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.32,0:51:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}四{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.32,0:51:55.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}三{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…three…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.22,0:51:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}二{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…two…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.02,0:51:58.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.46,0:52:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们原先不敢相信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't wanna believe it at first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.29,0:52:02.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}准备好没{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready or not…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.86,0:52:04.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们太天真{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all were so innocent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.93,0:52:07.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…here I come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.63,0:52:09.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}至于你 南希{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you, Nancy…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.20,0:52:12.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在画什么 不错啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you drawing? That is so good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.04,0:52:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是他最得意门生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}… you were his favorite of all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.67,0:52:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我这里有其他画{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? I got some other drawings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.08,0:52:20.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}画得不怎样 或许你帮我修改{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they're, like, really bad drawings. Maybe you can help me fix them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.61,0:52:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}接着我们注意到一些事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then we started to notice things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.19,0:52:32.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他近来举止有点怪异{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Uh, he has been acting a little strange lately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.76,0:52:36.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他把我们带到秘密洞穴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He takes us to the secret cave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.20,0:52:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. It's all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.50,0:52:43.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跟着你们就报警{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what did you do? Did you call the police?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.84,0:52:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当我们要对付他时 他已离开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He left town before we ever were able to confront him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.14,0:52:51.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他离开 不能再伤害你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gone. He can't hurt you anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.18,0:52:53.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以你们都会梦见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So these dreams that you're having…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.81,0:52:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们被压抑的记忆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…they're repressed memories…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.35,0:53:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来于那可怖的时光{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…from a terrible, terrible time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.19,0:53:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}希望你是对的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope that you're right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.03,0:53:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们要找出相中其他小孩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to find the other kids in the picture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.70,0:53:13.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你们在说什么 不行 - 一点意义也没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you talking about? No. - It doesn't make any sense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.67,0:53:16.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 必须知己知彼 - 肯定有意义{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There's gotta be more to it. It's not… - This makes total sense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.87,0:53:18.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听你妈妈话 那只是回忆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard your mom. These are just memories.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.10,0:53:21.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 若她错了 - 我们仍在经受那般生活…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What if she's wrong? - We're experiencing them…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.54,0:53:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 而你们却说只是回忆 - 你知道什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- living them, but they're just memories. - How do you know that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.78,0:53:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}回忆不会杀人的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Memories don't kill you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.79,0:53:37.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 伟庭 上车 - 是我爸爸 我得走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Whoa, whoa, whoa! Quentin, get in the car. - It's my dad. I gotta go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.29,0:53:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我们要采取措施 - 停{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We have to do something. - Look, stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.13,0:53:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太荒谬了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is crazy. Listen to yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.73,0:53:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.75,0:54:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}希望你们做四百秒热身运动 二百下的胸压式游泳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to do 400 warm-up. Then do a 200-back-breast drill swim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.62,0:54:09.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伟庭 集中 清醒 进入状态{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quentin, I need you to focus. I need you to wake up, get into this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.89,0:54:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}继续 好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go. All right, guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.96,0:54:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上去 继续{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Step up. Let's go. On the blocks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.96,0:54:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}打破你记录{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take your mark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.88,0:55:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}确保你们在水中正常发挥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make sure you're working your underwaters…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.05,0:55:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}成功转身 进出都十分快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…hit the turns, in and out really quick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.12,0:55:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如海豚般有力离开墙面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Powerful dolphins off the wall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.26,0:55:21.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们要做多次三百秒 下降四次 控制在五至八次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, guys, we're gonna do eight 300s, descend one to four, hold five to eight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.89,0:55:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}离开 我们开始{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, hop out. On the blocks, guys. Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.07,0:55:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}加速{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's step up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.44,0:55:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}打破你记录{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take your mark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.35,0:55:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}继续 快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, pick it up. Let's go. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.28,0:55:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}开始 不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on, let's go. Attaboy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.12,0:55:51.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, now. Come on. Come on, let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.59,0:55:54.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.16,0:55:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.10,0:56:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.71,0:56:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.33,0:57:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.93,0:57:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 佛莱迪 - 出来 你个衰人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Krueger! - Come on out, you bastard!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.38,0:57:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快开门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goddamn it. You open this door, Krueger!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.25,0:57:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们想干嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think I did?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.52,0:57:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我们不会对你怎样 - 开门 滚出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I didn't do anything! - Get your ass out. Open the fucking door!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.09,0:57:29.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 休想我开门 - 阿乐 把守后门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I didn't do it! - Norm, make sure…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.92,0:57:32.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 他不能从后面出去 - 好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …he can't get out the back! - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.96,0:57:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}停手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.56,0:57:41.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}停下 好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop. Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.34,0:57:48.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.58,0:58:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你要干嘛 不可以这样做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing? No, no, no. This isn't the right way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.72,0:58:02.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我们可以报警 - 非做不可{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We gotta call the police. - What is the right way?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.16,0:58:06.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们的小孩饱受折磨 一定要以牙还牙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our kids get on a stand, tell a room of people what happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.36,0:58:08.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我们要报警 - 他说得对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, we've got to call the police. - He's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.66,0:58:11.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 并非只有此办法 - 今晚来个了断{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is not the way to do this. - This ends tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.67,0:58:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.18,0:58:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为我儿子报仇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is for my son!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.23,0:58:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}出来 克鲁格{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come out, Krueger!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.62,0:59:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.40,0:59:19.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没事吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.53,0:59:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去找护士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go get the nurse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.17,0:59:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}深呼吸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breathe, breathe. Come on. Come on, breathe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.17,0:59:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 放松 深呼吸 - 我没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Relax and breathe. Come on. Come on. - I'm okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.13,0:59:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}昨晚我做了另个恶梦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had another nightmare last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.33,0:59:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个穿条纹毛衣的烧伤男人试图杀我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That burned man with the striped sweater, he keeps trying to kill me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.54,1:00:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我向不同路段跑 最后到步幼稚园{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ran a different way this time. I ended up in front of a preschool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.94,1:00:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}醒之前我有机会查探 但感觉匪夷所思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I woke up before I had a chance to explore, but it has to mean something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.91,1:00:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这次他追逐我进入幼稚园{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He chased me into the preschool this time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.85,1:00:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我逃避到地下室{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got away, made it down to the basement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.25,1:00:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}似乎他有意要我去地下室{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it feels like that's where he wants me to go. Like…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.29,1:00:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他想我去找什么似的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}… he needs me to find something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.86,1:00:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一闭眼就做梦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm starting to dream with my eyes open.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.29,1:00:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不能分辨梦与实{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't tell what's real anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.43,1:00:27.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我三天没入睡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't slept in three days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.40,1:00:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一入睡就会做梦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I sleep, I dream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.77,1:00:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一发梦就会猝死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I dream, I'm dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.41,1:00:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是否有相同感受之人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there anybody else out there that this is happening to?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.18,1:00:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有人拯救我吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can somebody help me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.95,1:00:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}劳驾{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.54,1:01:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们真的死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're all dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.01,1:01:09.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知佛莱迪发生何遭遇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what happened to Freddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.41,1:01:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你杀了佛莱迪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed Krueger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.01,1:01:18.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你在哪听来的 - 你追赶他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where'd you hear that name? - You chased him…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.32,1:01:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}令他陷入绝境并烧死他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…cornered him and burned him to death. You hunted him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.05,1:01:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们没杀他 我们是在保护你们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did not hunt him. We were protecting you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.49,1:01:25.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 为什么 - 惩罚他的所为{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- From what? - From him. From what he did to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.16,1:01:29.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 皆因你们所说 - 那时我们才五岁 年幼不懂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- From what you kids told us he did to you. - We were 5. We would've said anything!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.93,1:01:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 为什么不报警 - 你还年少无知{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why didn't you go to the police? - You were so young.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.53,1:01:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们指责他折磨我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. God! And the things we said he did…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.34,1:01:39.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们有没有发现那洞穴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cave. Did you ever find it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.60,1:01:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.34,1:01:45.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}何以定罪于他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know he was guilty?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.51,1:01:49.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 哦 天啊 - 你滥杀无辜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, my God. - You killed an innocent man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.31,1:01:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯 嗯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm-mm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.55,1:01:54.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}每次我经过事发地 往事历历在目{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's not a day that goes by that I don't think about that night, Quentin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.29,1:01:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你活该{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good, you deserve at least that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.46,1:02:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伟庭 当你长大成人有妻室{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quentin. When you grow up and you have kids…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.16,1:02:04.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}便能感同为父感受{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I hope you never know the feeling of utterly failing to protect them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.66,1:02:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 别碰我 - 乖仔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't touch… Don't touch me. - Son…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.04,1:02:18.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听我说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You listen to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.74,1:02:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所有人都知道佛莱迪·克鲁格是不存在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As far as everyone around here is concerned, Fred Krueger never existed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.05,1:02:28.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伟庭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quentin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.49,1:02:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quentin, wait. Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.56,1:02:33.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 什么 - 冷静{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Slow down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.33,1:02:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 停 - 我们害了他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stop. - We got him killed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.76,1:02:38.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们讲大话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our stories, our lies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.53,1:02:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 若我们能让他住手 - 行吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What if we can make him stop? - What if we can?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.83,1:02:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}曼加说过佛莱迪想让他在幼稚园找东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The preschool. Marcus said that Freddy wanted him to find something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.14,1:02:45.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.67,1:02:49.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}南希{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nancy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.12,1:03:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}出来闲逛吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you wanna hang out, Nancy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.00,1:03:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.44,1:03:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我刚见克莉丝被装在尸袋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just saw Kris in a body bag.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.58,1:03:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你已经很久没入睡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, you've been up for too long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.81,1:03:28.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你有幻觉 我们要快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're having micronaps. We gotta go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.95,1:03:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们要去幼稚园{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go find the preschool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.76,1:03:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来这里干嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.56,1:03:41.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}买些药丸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need more pills.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.78,1:04:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.96,1:04:24.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要这种药{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. Um, I'm gonna need a, um, refill on that, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.74,1:04:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有替换的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}On this, you're out of refills.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.57,1:04:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我得咨询医生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna have to call the doctor on this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.31,1:04:35.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我现在等不了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I don't have time to call a doctor. Look…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.82,1:04:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.14,1:05:00.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我十五岁便开始用这药{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I've been on this stuff since I was 15.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.51,1:05:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}完全没不良反应{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? It's totally fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.77,1:05:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只需装满它 几颗也行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just go back, you fill it up and… Even just a couple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.88,1:05:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 几颗也行 - 不行 很抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All I need is a couple. - No. No, I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.34,1:05:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伟庭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quentin. Quentin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.84,1:05:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 装满它 - 不行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just fill it up. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.80,1:06:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.78,1:06:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}醒醒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.48,1:06:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你流血啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're bleeding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.32,1:06:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}发生什么事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.86,1:07:01.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}坚持{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.36,1:07:04.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的毛衣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}His sweater.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.63,1:07:05.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 好的 - 他在这{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - He's here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.23,1:07:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你伤得不轻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, you're hurt really bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.67,1:07:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快去医院{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go to the hospital. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.31,1:07:21.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}贝·文生医生请到ICU{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Blake Mason to ICU, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.76,1:07:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}乖女{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.12,1:07:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}发生什么事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, honey, honey, honey, what happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.13,1:07:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谁干的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who did this to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.90,1:07:39.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你深知肚明{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at it, Mom. You know who did it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.70,1:07:43.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你深知肚明{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know who did it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.04,1:07:45.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, honey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.42,1:08:05.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们怎么弄呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, how we doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.39,1:08:07.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很快没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna be okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.26,1:08:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给你一点镇静剂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna give you a little something for the pain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.90,1:08:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 它会让你昏睡 - 没事的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It'll put you right out. - It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.23,1:08:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Mom, I don't want it. I don't want it. I don't want it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.10,1:08:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 没事的 - 不 妈妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's okay, it's okay. - No, Mom, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.97,1:08:22.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我不需要 - 可能会有点痛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't want it. Don't let her do it. - This might sting a bit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.51,1:08:24.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 不 不 - 不 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! No! - No, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.24,1:08:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 好的 好的 - 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. Okay. - No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.91,1:08:28.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 伟庭在哪 - 我能和你到走廊商量些事吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's Quentin? - Can I have a word with you in the hall?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.21,1:08:32.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别离开我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't leave. Don't leave, Mom. Mom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.75,1:08:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伟庭在哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Quentin? I need Quentin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.36,1:08:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如今唯一办法就是令媛需注射镇静剂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your daughter needs to be sedated, but I can't do anything…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.33,1:08:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我需要你首肯 - 我不想她不再受痛苦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- without your authorization. - I just want her to be out of pain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.93,1:08:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好 签名{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Sign this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.57,1:08:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}令媛会没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll be fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.05,1:09:09.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.07,1:09:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.41,1:09:31.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 还好吧 - 嗯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You okay? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.24,1:09:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 怎么 - 这是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah? - What is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.71,1:09:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 肾上腺激素 可以保持清醒 - 怎么得到的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Adrenaline. Keep us awake. - Where'd you get it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.08,1:09:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在护士的送药车偷的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I stole it off one of the nurse's carts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.08,1:09:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不能吃 你不知它会否有副作用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't take that. You have no idea what it's gonna do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.89,1:09:47.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我别无可选 你要吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? That is kind of the least of my concerns right now. You want some?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.76,1:09:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.13,1:09:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.73,1:09:57.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没事吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.34,1:10:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I'm good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.98,1:10:05.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.35,1:10:11.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 有多远 - 快到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How much further? - We're almost there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.48,1:10:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和我聊天 我怕睡着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, will you talk to me? I'm falling asleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.42,1:10:17.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}聊什么好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. What do you wanna talk about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.39,1:10:21.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我没主意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.59,1:10:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你最喜欢什么颜色{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your favorite color?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.50,1:10:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}蓝色{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.87,1:10:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}介不介意说说你这几年怎么过的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, if you really wanna talk, how come over the last couple years…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.38,1:10:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}每次我约你 你都没赴约{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…every time I've invited you out, you've just never shown up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.78,1:10:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道你注意到没 我的确不适{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know if you've noticed, but I don't exactly fit in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.06,1:10:53.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}若我们能活过接下来的二十四小时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, look, if we survive the next 24 hours…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.93,1:10:56.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们就来次真的约会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…then I'll take you out on a real date.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.37,1:11:02.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不肯呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what if I say no?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.64,1:11:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么快就拒绝我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, why don't you sleep on it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.55,1:11:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 怎样 - 没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You okay? - I'm fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.19,1:11:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.96,1:11:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我刚才见到他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw him. He was right there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.63,1:11:34.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta go. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.08,1:11:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就这{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.12,1:11:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就这间学校{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the school.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.75,1:12:28.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.09,1:12:30.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没事吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.69,1:12:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我分不清梦与现实{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what's real anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.69,1:12:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.33,1:12:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跟着我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.56,1:13:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给我打火机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, give me your lighter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.50,1:13:22.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在我们在这里又能怎样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, now that we're here, now what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.77,1:13:25.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我都不记得{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I don't remember any of this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.15,1:13:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是他房间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This must be his room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.18,1:13:35.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他带我们来这里是有原因{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, he brought us here for a reason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.42,1:13:40.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是他房间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is definitely his room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.01,1:13:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伟庭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quentin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.02,1:14:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 怎么 - 有东西在那后面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - There's something back there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.47,1:14:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我之前来过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been here before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.47,1:15:00.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}若你保密 我带你去个特别地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you can keep a secret, I'll take you to a special place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.17,1:16:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那些是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are those?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.48,1:16:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谁的照片{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are those pictures of?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.75,1:16:16.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的照片{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're all of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.72,1:16:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 让我看 - 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let me see. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.63,1:16:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.33,1:16:38.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}噢 天哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.04,1:16:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.34,1:16:45.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们错了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.44,1:16:49.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他痛恨我们非因我们撒谎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not after us because we lied.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.08,1:16:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而是我们揭发真相{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's after us because we told the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.09,1:16:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要我们来是为让我们忆起他的所为{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He brought us here so we would remember what he did to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.89,1:17:02.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天哪 该死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}God. Fuck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.33,1:17:07.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}该死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.67,1:17:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他想从我们得到什么 他不会停手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does he want from us? He's never gonna stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.28,1:17:24.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道我们该做什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what we need to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.78,1:17:27.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.36,1:17:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一定有其他方法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's gotta be another way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.93,1:17:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}坐以待毙 只能等死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we just sit here and do nothing, we're gonna die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.83,1:17:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我来负责 - 我负责扯他毛衣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I should do this. - I'm the one who pulled his sweater out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.33,1:17:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}若我是唯一能由梦中带他出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if I'm the only one who can bring him out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.07,1:17:52.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不能让你睡着 不然你就醒不过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nancy, I can't let you go to sleep. You're not gonna wake up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.68,1:17:55.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道你不会让它发生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you won't let that happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.65,1:18:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}若你看我在挣扎 就叫醒我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake me up if you see me struggle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.03,1:18:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}希望带给你好运{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotta believe in something, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.91,1:18:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会一直陪伴你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna be here when you get up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.62,1:18:33.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}会成功的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna make it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.32,1:20:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 该死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw, shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.01,1:20:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你救不了她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't save her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.85,1:20:50.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}捉到你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tag.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.76,1:20:53.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你好碍眼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.16,1:20:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}佛莱迪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Krueger!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.03,1:21:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你女友来了 我会回来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your girlfriend's here. I'll be right back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.57,1:21:09.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一 二{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, two{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.71,1:21:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}猜猜谁为你而来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess who's coming for you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.18,1:21:19.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小南希{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little Nancy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.05,1:21:23.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你找我了 接下玩什么游戏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that you caught me, what game do you wanna play next?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.29,1:21:26.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 去你的 - 好像很好玩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fuck you. - Ooh. Sounds like fun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.39,1:21:28.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}进度是快了点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a little fast for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.43,1:21:32.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吊起来做怎样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about we hang first?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.83,1:21:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. It's not real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.97,1:21:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.31,1:21:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.03,1:23:14.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来个春梦怎么样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, how's this for a wet dream?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.41,1:24:02.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伟庭 叫醒我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quentin, wake me up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.38,1:24:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这群{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This dress…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.35,1:24:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一直是我心头好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…was always one of my favorites.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.99,1:24:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还记得吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you remember it, Nancy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.13,1:24:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你当然记得{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course you do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.06,1:24:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在你记得一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remember everything now, don't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.17,1:24:27.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的记忆刺激了我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your memories are what fuels me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.37,1:24:31.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Please don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.04,1:24:36.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你真是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mouth says no…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.55,1:24:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}口不对心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but your body says yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.19,1:24:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不要躲开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't turn away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.89,1:24:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看着我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.16,1:24:50.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看我要对你做什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look what you did to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.67,1:24:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}游戏开始{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now it's time to play.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.58,1:25:11.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}过瘾吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you having fun?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.12,1:25:20.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你好顽皮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naughty girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.76,1:25:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你伤害不到我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't hurt me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.77,1:25:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你所处我的世界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're in my world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.20,1:25:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你离开不了的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you can't ever leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.19,1:25:51.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}叫声简直引人入胜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's music to my ears.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.89,1:25:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要清醒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna wake up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.73,1:25:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不能醒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't wake up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.49,1:26:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你已经很久没入睡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to keep you awake long enough so when you finally slept…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.53,1:26:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你绝不会再醒来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you'd never wake up again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.70,1:26:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}南希 醒醒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nancy, wake up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.84,1:26:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}南希 醒醒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake up, Nancy, wake up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.61,1:26:14.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我们在这里长相厮守{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna be in here a long time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.58,1:26:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 南希 快醒 - 你认为你男友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nancy, please! - Did you really think your boyfriend…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.28,1:26:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 可以叫醒你 - 不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- could wake you up? - Please, don't do this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.25,1:26:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}求求你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.19,1:26:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是你现任男友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm your boyfriend now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.02,1:26:29.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}南希 回来 快醒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nancy, come back! Please, wake up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.09,1:26:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你答应过的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You promised!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.51,1:26:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}发个好梦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweet dreams.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.92,1:27:00.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伟庭 捉住他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quentin, get him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.14,1:27:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你个衰人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Die! Fucking bastard!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.75,1:27:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}雕虫小技{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice try, Nancy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.31,1:27:25.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在该我试试{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now let me take a stab.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.76,1:27:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么你还没死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, why don't you just fucking die?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.07,1:27:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很痛吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It hurts, doesn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.21,1:27:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是你现在在现实世界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's because you're in my world now, bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.88,1:28:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.08,1:29:09.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 给我一些时间 - 瞄高一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Give me some slack. - Yeah, aim it up a little higher.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.29,1:29:12.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有任何身体的迹象{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No sign of a body anywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.08,1:29:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好 伟庭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Quentin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.22,1:29:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恶梦完了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nightmare's over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.38,1:30:12.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你快去休息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to go straight up to bed, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.08,1:30:14.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.52,1:30:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗨 妈妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Mom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.12,1:30:25.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道你只想保护我 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you were just trying to protect me. Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.50,1:30:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你没事就好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just glad you're safe.{\r}
